              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಜನನ — janana — \"a birth\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಗುವಿನ ಜನನ ಆಸ್ಪತ್ರೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಆಯಿತು. maguvina janana āspatreyalli āyitu. The baby was born in the hospital."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A formal word: ಜನನ (janana) ಪ್ರಮಾಣಪತ್ರ, a birth certificate. At home people say ಹುಟ್ಟು."
            }
          ]
        },
