              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಗುವಿನ ನಾಮಕರಣ ಹನ್ನೊಂದನೆಯ ದಿನ ನಡೆಯಿತು. maguvina nāmakaraṇa hannondaneya dina naḍeyitu. The baby's naming ceremony took place on the eleventh day."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The day a baby gets its name, often with the baby in a cradle."
            }
