              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಉತ್ತರಾಧಿಕಾರಿ — uttarādhikāri — \"a successor\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆ ಮಗು ರಾಜನ ಉತ್ತರಾಧಿಕಾರಿ ಆಯಿತು. ā magu rājana uttarādhikāri āyitu. That child became the king's successor."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಉತ್ತರಾಧಿಕಾರಿಗಳು, uttarādhikārigaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The one who takes over a throne, a post or property after someone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
